  G ∣ F ∧ G ≠ 0 ∧ AbsIrred G ∧
  ∃ α β : ℕ, 1 ≤ α ∧ 1 ≤ β ∧ thr ≤ α + k * β ∧ Bihom G α β

private def HighUnionK (k thr : ℕ) (x D E : ℝ) (M j : ℕ)
