    HasThreeProjectiveZeros R∨ (∃c:ℤ,R=u2 c*uQ 1^n)∨ ei n R:=by
  by_cases ht:HasThreeProjectiveZeros R
  · exact Or.inl ht
  · exact Or.inr (wc n hn R hR hR0 ht hInf
